msgstr "暂无已保存项目"

msgid "Off by default. When on, this browser remembers the identities you open, up to 50 per network."
msgstr "默认关闭。开启后，此浏览器会记住你打开的身份，每个网络最多 50 个。"

msgid "OK"
msgstr "确定"

