msgstr "请求超时（毫秒）"

msgid "Requests appear here as pages load."
msgstr "页面加载时，请求会显示在这里。"

msgid "Requests this tab made, newest first"
msgstr "此标签页发出的请求，最新的在前"

msgid "Reset"
msgstr "重置"

msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"

msgid "Retries"
msgstr "重试次数"

msgid "Round"
msgstr "轮次"

msgid "Save changes"
msgstr "保存更改"

msgid "Saved"
msgstr "已保存"

msgid "Saved devnets"
msgstr "已保存的开发网"

msgid "Saved in this browser. A devnet with a name Radar doesn’t know asks for its addresses."
msgstr "保存在此浏览器中。如果开发网的名称 Radar 不认识，则需要填写其地址。"

msgid "Saved item"
msgstr "已保存项目"

msgid "Saved items"
msgstr "已保存项目"

msgid "Saved items cleared"
msgstr "已清除已保存项目"

msgid "SDK default"
msgstr "SDK 默认值"

msgid "SDK log level"
msgstr "SDK 日志级别"

msgid "See every source"
msgstr "查看所有数据源"

msgid "See every source and the switch"
msgstr "查看所有数据源和开关"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

msgid "Show the USD value next to DASH amounts"
msgstr "在 DASH 金额旁显示美元价值"

msgid "Show times in UTC"
msgstr "以 UTC 显示时间"

msgid "Source"
msgstr "数据源"

msgid "Sources"
msgstr "数据源"

msgid "Sources and licences"
msgstr "数据源和许可证"

msgid "Test coins have no value, so Testnet and devnets never show USD."
msgstr "测试币没有价值，因此测试网和开发网从不显示美元。"

msgid "Text that isn’t translated yet appears in English. Hashes, IDs and amounts are never translated."
msgstr "尚未翻译的文字将以英文显示。哈希、ID 和金额永远不会被翻译。"

#. placeholder {0}: formatInt(log.length)
msgid "The last {0} requests this tab made. Nothing here is sent anywhere."
msgstr "此标签页最近发出的 {0} 个请求。此处内容不会发送到任何地方。"

msgid "The last 100 requests this tab made, with the source, the node, how long each took and whether Decentralized only mode refused it."
msgstr "此标签页最近发出的 100 个请求，包括数据源、节点、每个请求的耗时，以及“仅去中心化”模式是否拒绝了它。"

msgid "The quorum list address must start with https://."
msgstr "Quorum 列表地址必须以 https:// 开头。"

msgid "The quorum list URL must start with https://."
msgstr "Quorum 列表 URL 必须以 https:// 开头。"

msgid "The SDK checked this proof against the trusted quorum keys before Radar showed the figure."
msgstr "在 Radar 显示该数据之前，SDK 已用受信任的 Quorum 密钥检查了此证明。"

msgid "The worker runs SDK {workerVersion} but this page was built with {PAGE_SDK_VERSION}. Reload the page; if it stays, clear this site’s data."
msgstr "Worker 运行的是 SDK {workerVersion}，但此页面是用 {PAGE_SDK_VERSION} 构建的。请重新加载页面；如果仍然如此，请清除本站数据。"

msgid "These choices stay in this browser. Radar never sends them anywhere."
msgstr "这些选项只保存在此浏览器中，Radar 绝不会将它们发送到任何地方。"

msgid "They feed the seed list for token holders: no index can list every holder of a token, so a token’s Holders tab starts from the identities you have opened. The list never leaves this browser, and turning this off erases it."
msgstr "它们用于生成代币持有者的种子列表：没有任何索引能列出某个代币的所有持有者，因此代币的“持有者”标签页从你打开过的身份开始。该列表不会离开此浏览器，关闭此项会将其清除。"

msgid "This network"
msgstr "本网络"

msgid "This proof is no longer held"
msgstr "不再持有此证明"

msgid "Times"
msgstr "时间"

msgid "To clear it: the buttons on Settings and Saved remove each list, “Clear the SDK cache” removes the cached answers, and your browser’s “clear site data” removes everything, including the service worker."
msgstr "清除方法：设置和已保存页面上的按钮会移除各自的列表，“清除 SDK 缓存”会移除缓存的回答，而浏览器的“清除站点数据”会移除所有内容，包括 Service Worker。"

msgid "To read the network, your browser asks DAPI nodes, the Platform SDK’s nodes and quorum list, and, unless you turn them off, Platform Explorer, Radar’s crawler, Hyphen, Insight and a price feed. Each one sees your IP address and what you asked it, like any web server."
msgstr "为了读取网络，你的浏览器会询问 DAPI 节点、Platform SDK 的节点和 Quorum 列表，并且（除非你关闭）还会询问 Platform Explorer、Radar 的爬虫、Hyphen、Insight 和价格数据源。与任何网络服务器一样，它们每一个都能看到你的 IP 地址和你询问的内容。"

msgid "Took"
msgstr "耗时"

msgid "Tools for checking what Radar asked and what it was told."
msgstr "用于检查 Radar 问了什么、得到了什么回答的工具。"

msgid "Unit for amounts"
msgstr "金额单位"

msgid "USD comes first, with the DASH figure after it once the rate is in."
msgstr "USD 排在前面，获取到汇率后，后面附上 DASH 数值。"

msgid "USD is for mainnet only: test coins have no value."
msgstr "美元仅适用于主网：测试币没有价值。"

msgid "USD is rounded to three significant figures and follows the amount in {unitName}."
msgstr "USD 四舍五入到三位有效数字，并跟随以 {unitName} 显示的金额。"

msgid "USD is rounded to three significant figures. This choice doesn’t apply while USD comes first."
msgstr "USD 四舍五入到三位有效数字。USD 排在前面时，此选项不适用。"

msgid "Use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens, for example \"ruby\"."
msgstr "请使用小写字母、数字和连字符，例如“ruby”。"

msgid "Verified"
msgstr "已验证"

msgid "Version mismatch"
msgstr "版本不匹配"

msgid "Viewed identities"
msgstr "浏览过的身份"

msgid "Viewed identities cleared"
msgstr "已清除浏览过的身份"

msgid "Wasm bindings"
msgstr "Wasm 绑定"

msgid "What “proof-checked” means"
msgstr "“已通过证明验证”是什么意思"

msgid "What can’t be listed without an index"
msgstr "没有索引就无法列出的内容"

msgid "When"
msgstr "时间"

msgid "Where to act"
msgstr "在哪里操作"

msgid "Whole number from {min} to {max}."
msgstr "从 {min} 到 {max} 的整数。"

msgid "Yes"
msgstr "是"

msgid "Yes, remove"
msgstr "是，移除"

msgid "You"
msgstr "我的"

msgid "Your names"
msgstr "你的名称"

msgid "Your own names"
msgstr "你自己的名称"
